---@field server_tool_results? anthropic.beta_sessions.BetaManagedAgentsWebFetchUrlSourceToolFilterParams|distilled.Null Which of the web_search and web_fetch tools' results contribute URLs that may be fetched: "all" (the default), "none", or an only or except list. Each name in a list must be "web_search" or "web_fetch".

