---@field session_id string
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_sessions.UpdateSessionRequestAnthropicBetaList This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
