---@field title? string|distilled.Null Human-readable session title.
---@field metadata? anthropic.beta_sessions.UpdateSessionRequestMetadataMap|distilled.Null Metadata patch. Set a key to a string to upsert it, or to null to delete it. Omit the field to preserve.
---@field vault_ids? anthropic.beta_sessions.UpdateSessionRequestVaultIdsList Vault IDs (`vlt_*`) to attach to the session. Not yet supported; requests setting this field are rejected. Reserved for future use.
---@field agent? anthropic.beta_sessions.BetaManagedAgentsSessionAgentUpdate Agent configuration update. Only `tools` and `mcp_servers` are updatable mid-session. Only valid for sessions created from an agent or deployment reference. The session must not be running.
---@field budget? anthropic.beta_sessions.BetaManagedAgentsBudgetLimit|distilled.Null Enforced spend ceiling for the session. Set an object to replace the budget of a session that was created with one, or `null` to remove it; omit to preserve. A budget cannot be added to a session created without one (rejected with reason `budget_create_only`), and a removed budget cannot be re-added. Allowed in any non-terminated status. Lowering `max_list_cost` to at or below the session's consumed list cost is rejected with reason `budget_not_raised`, and every model the session can run must have a public list price or the request is rejected with reason `model_not_budgetable`.

---This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
---@alias anthropic.beta_sessions.UpdateSessionRequestAnthropicBetaList anthropic.beta_sessions.AnthropicBeta[]

